  [vangogh2020] 4. van Gogh V, The Accessible Reading Group. Screen readers and the reading of mathematics. In: Proceedings of the Conference on Accessible Reading. Accessible Press; 2020:101-110.
  [muller2019] 5. Müller J. Hörbücher und Sprachsynthese. PhD thesis. Universität Wien; 2019.
  [who2021] 6. World Health Organization. World Report on Vision & Print Disability. World Health Organization; 2021. https://example.org/who_report?id=1&lang=en
  [access2024] 7. Doe J. Designing for keyboard and screen reader users. Accessibility Notes. January 15, 2024. Accessed September 1, 2026. https://example.org/notes/keyboard
